@startuml Linkwise_Chat_Contact_States
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Latin Modern Roman"
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam ArrowColor #2A9D8F
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam nodesep 22
skinparam ranksep 28
title UML state machine: one local contact operation (proposed)
[*] --> Prepared : lease + config
Prepared --> Authorized : policy grant
Prepared --> Abandoned : invalidated
Authorized --> Abandoned : invalidated
Abandoned --> [*]
Authorized --> Establishing : valid start
Establishing --> Exchanging : established
Exchanging --> Closing : stop exchange
Establishing --> Releasing : fault
Exchanging --> Releasing : fault
Closing --> Releasing : release
Releasing --> [*] : released + recorded
Releasing --> Faulted : unknown release
Faulted --> [*] : reconciled
note right of Prepared
Operation starts from station idle.
Completion returns ownership to idle.
end note
note right of Faulted
No new contact before reconciliation.
Contact success is not delivery.
end note
@enduml
